{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/1c5c8da3aceef54f59c5f66ca03f537c.poster.avif?t=1768201999\" width=600 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/1c5c8da3aceef54f59c5f66ca03f537c.webm?t=1768201999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/1c5c8da3aceef54f59c5f66ca03f537c.mp4?t=1768201999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No ammo, not much special weapons, you are on your own to survive the horror!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape from the doctors and creatures if you don't want a passive, painful radioactive gas death. Everything is corrupted here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your one and only friend is small bottles of holy water and your courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>&quot;The Lord is near to all who call on him, to all who call on him in truth&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/bff05b91ed2e0746df17816ffd7dcf36.poster.avif?t=1768201999\" width=684 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/bff05b91ed2e0746df17816ffd7dcf36.webm?t=1768201999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cult Trials: Incarnation, you are Amelia, who woke up from deep-death sleep and found herself in a dark, corrupted world. Deep mystery awaits you as you slowly dive deep  and follow the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is going to be a trilogy of 3 chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot; We stood and watched as God abandoned us, and then we did the best we could.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/8dce45c16691d4d63d657216d79bd2c0.poster.avif?t=1768201999\" width=634 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/8dce45c16691d4d63d657216d79bd2c0.webm?t=1768201999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore environments and Intense Psychological Horror</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/0455b5f47ed277d70dab9153311a42b5.poster.avif?t=1768201999\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/0455b5f47ed277d70dab9153311a42b5.webm?t=1768201999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome Puzzles, Actions, and Secrets to Uncover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/4f14c2872a41c9a36dfc2611d59a0505.poster.avif?t=1768201999\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/4f14c2872a41c9a36dfc2611d59a0505.webm?t=1768201999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p c